WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.506
MARISA COULTER:<i> There
are forces out there, Lyra...</i>

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:12.545
<i> that you can't begin
 to understand.</i>

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:16.282
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.318
I know you won't believe me.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.754
<i> I am doing this for you.</i>

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:27.560
SPEAKER:
<i>I am gathering the greatest...</i>

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:30.663
<i> from every world...</i>

00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:35.335
<i> to help me wage war.</i>

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:39.472
Tell me who this war
is really against....

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:42.675
and what you want from us.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:48.815
Try not to die.

00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:53.787
♪ (EPIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.491
COULTER:<i> Many times, I've
tried to save her from danger.</i>

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:00.794
It's cost me everything.

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:04.697
What could be more dangerous
than you?

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:07.100
The truth.

00:01:09.802 --> 00:01:11.637
LYRA SILVERTONGUE:<i> When I
was asleep, Roger spoke to me.</i>

00:01:11.937 --> 00:01:13.139
ROGER PARSLOW:<i> Lyra!</i>

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.475
I can feel death in there.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:16.643
(SCREECHES)

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.080
(SNARLING)

00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:22.749
SPEAKER 2:<i> The Authority...</i>

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:24.784
they have a power...

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:27.687
<i> far greater
 than our comprehension.</i>

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:32.192
WILL PARRY:
<i>What if I can't come back?</i>

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:35.395
We'll find you.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.234
SPEAKER:<i> They are
but one arm of the beast.</i>

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:43.703
<i> We cut off the head.</i>

00:01:47.339 --> 00:01:49.409
Then, the rest will crumble.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.313
No turning back, I guess.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:54.681
No turning back.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.317
(SHRIEKS)

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.591
This is the final rebellion.

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:15.668
Well, I'll be damned.

